msgctxt "76"
msgid "What kind of favor are we talking?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "It's gotta do with the little lady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "You mean the girl with the sketchbook?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr "Esatto."

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"Two nights ago, she just... disappeared. Nobody knows where\r\n"
"she could've gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "You think she ran away?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Dunno. We got men searchin' the streets and all, but they\r\n"
"haven't found so much as a trace of her yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "And have you gone to the police?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Well, not exactly..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Why not? You should file a missing persons report."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "I dunno that we really can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Well the truth of it is... she's the daughter of a guy the\r\n"
"boss used to do business with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"Now the boss is taking care of the girl, yeah. But he never\r\n"
"officially adopted her. If the cops found out about that,\r\n"
"they'd ship her back to her parents no questions asked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "And we don't want that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"Right. Saki-san's parents are real scum o' the earth,\r\n"
"lemme tell you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"Her dad gambled all their money away and then some, then\r\n"
"would come home stinkin' of booze and beat the daylights\r\n"
"outta the girl and her mom."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"Her mom, on the other hand, was always sleeping around.\r\n"
"Acted like she didn't want a damn thing to do with her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "So then Nakahara took Saki in to protect her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Yup."
msgstr "Già."

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"Three years back, we got asked to collect on her dad's\r\n"
"gamblin' debt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"So the boss went over to their house. But when he walked\r\n"
"inside..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr "Che è successo?"

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"He found the guy dead, hangin' blue-faced from a rope in\r\n"
"their living room. Saki-san still clutching his lifeless leg."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "...And her mom?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Probably off with one of her fuck boys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Lady never gave a single shit about Saki-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Which is why Nakahara took her in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Yup."
msgstr "Già."

msgctxt "424"
msgid "The boss looks scary, sure... but he's got a good heart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "It just wasn't in him to leave Saki-san like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid ""
"And yeah he complained at first about how much trouble\r\n"
"it was raising a kid, but it wasn't long 'til he ended up\r\n"
"a proud father."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "Now he treats Saki-chan like she's his own flesh n' blood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "That's amazing."
msgstr "È incredibile."

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"Yup, but word has it her mom's back in town. That she wants\r\n"
"to take Saki-san back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "Why now, after all this time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Beats me."
msgstr "Non lo so."

msgctxt "520"
msgid ""
"Probably so she can have a maid to do all the housework\r\n"
"while she goes out and parties."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"Anyway, the boss has been tryin' to keep the little lady in\r\n"
"the office so her mom wouldn't be able to find her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "Which is why she was there when I stopped by."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "Yup. And now that she's missin', the boss is real worried."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Saki's not a child anymore, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "Couldn't she just call him if she needed to?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "Call him? Not a chance in hell!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "...Why not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "The girl's mute!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cosa!?"

msgctxt "640"
msgid ""
"The doctor said it's some kinda mental block, probably\r\n"
"from watching her dad hang himself right in front of her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "So you see, she can't call us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "And that's why she has the sketchbook..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid "C'mon, Aniki! We gotta find her as soon as possible! Please!"
msgstr ""

